{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂此第七是持業釋，以識體上親持恒審思量\n業故。如藏識者，第八識體親持三種含藏義故。亦名體持業、用持業釋，故此識體即是意故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂彼第六名依主釋。意根為主，意識所依。\n如眼為主，眼識所依。俱名能所依，彰依主釋，故彼識體異於意故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "積集名心，了別名識。意唯思量，無彼二義，故但名意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即善等三性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即凡聖諸地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即長短時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即八種識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善性易世，不能改也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果隨業轉，業有盡故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惡性易世，不能改也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果隨業轉，業有盡故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即下品轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即中品轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結顯因中轉義，故名皆容"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即下品轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即中品轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結顯因中轉義，故云皆容"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結生即投\n胎時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此頌喻也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此頌法也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯此有心故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
